  * pwsh scripts/ai/ecosystem.ps1 -Action Validate: PASS
  * pwsh scripts/ai/ecosystem.ps1 -Action Test: ALL 21 TESTS PASS
  * pwsh scripts/ai/ecosystem.ps1 -Action Status: 9Router RUNNING

